-- Maximum Item Entries Per Order: 21

-- ITEM AND FREIGHT VALUES
-- Recorded Item Price: R$13,591,643.70
-- Recorded Freight Amount: R$2,251,909.54
-- Recorded Item and Freight Value: R$15,843,553.24
-- Average Item Price per Entry: R$120.65
-- Average Freight per Item Entry: R$19.99
-- Freight Share: 14.21%

-- CATALOG QUALITY
-- Total Catalog Products: 32,951
-- Translated Catalog Products: 32,328
-- Untranslated Catalog Products: 13
-- Missing-Category Catalog Products: 610
-- Catalog Products Missing Physical Attributes: 2
-- Zero-Weight Catalog Products: 4


-- =====================================================
-- SECTION 6: MATHEMATICAL CONSISTENCY
-- =====================================================

-- Item Price + Freight = Item and Freight Value
-- 13,591,643.70 + 2,251,909.54 = 15,843,553.24

-- Orders without item records: 775
-- 99,441 - 98,666 = 775

-- Extra item entries beyond first per represented order:
-- 112,650 - 98,666 = 13,984

-- IMPORTANT
-- Extra item entries (13,984) and orders with
-- multiple item entries (9,803) are different metrics.

-- Catalog classification partition:
-- 32,328 + 13 + 610 = 32,951


