-- =====================================================
-- SECTION 9: BUSINESS DEFINITIONS AND LIMITATIONS
-- =====================================================

-- 1. Item value is based on recorded source item prices.
--    It is not necessarily recognized revenue.

-- 2. Freight amount represents recorded freight charges.
--    It is not necessarily actual carrier cost.

-- 3. Item and Freight Value must not automatically
--    be treated as Recorded Payment Volume.

-- 4. Product and Seller measures use fact_order_items.
--    Their filter behavior follows the Item fact.

-- 5. Product/Seller dimensions do not directly
--    filter fact_orders or fact_payments.

-- 6. Multiple-item statistics are based on visible
--    item records within the current filter context.

-- 7. Catalog quality measures describe dim_product.
--    They do not necessarily change under Purchase Date
--    filters because Product does not receive filters
--    back from the Item fact.

-- 8. All source-quality exceptions remain preserved.
--    No records were removed for reporting convenience.

-- =====================================================
-- END OF FILE
